Value Filldown VENDOR (.+?)
Value SOFTWARE_VERSION (.+?)
Value BOOT_IMAGE (.+?)
Value SYSTEM_IMAGE (.+?)
Value Required SLOT (.+?)
Value Fillup UPTIME (.+?)
Value BOARD_TYPE (.+?)
Value DRAM (.+?)
Value FLASH (.+?)
Value REBOOT_REASON (.+?)
Value HOSTNAME (.+?)
Value Fillup SERIAL (.+?)
Value BIOS (.+?)
Value ROMMON (.+?)
Value SOFTWARE_IMAGE (.+?)
Value CONFIG_REGISTER (.+?)
Value Fillup MAC_ADDRESS (.+?)
Value RESTARTED (.+?)

Start
  ^${VENDOR} IOS.*Software,.*Version\s+${SOFTWARE_VERSION},\s+RELEASE
  ^ROM:\s+${ROMMON}\s*$$
  ^${HOSTNAME}\s+uptime is\s+${UPTIME}\s*$$
  ^System image file is "${SYSTEM_IMAGE}"\s*$$
  ^Last reload reason:\s+${REBOOT_REASON}\s*$$
  ^System restarted at\s+${RESTARTED}\s*$$
  ^cisco\s+${BOARD_TYPE}\s+\(.+?\) processor.*with\s+${DRAM}\s+of memory\.
  ^Processor board ID\s+${SERIAL}\s*$$
  ^Configuration register is\s+${CONFIG_REGISTER}\s*$$
  ^Base ethernet MAC Address\s*:\s+${MAC_ADDRESS}\s*$$
  ^Switch Ports Model -> Members

Members
  ^\s*\*?\s*${SLOT}\s+\d+\s+${BOARD_TYPE}\s+${SOFTWARE_VERSION}\s+${SOFTWARE_IMAGE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^Switch\s+\d+ -> Detail

Detail
  ^Switch Uptime\s*:\s+${UPTIME}\s*$$
  ^Base ethernet MAC Address\s*:\s+${MAC_ADDRESS}\s*$$
  ^System serial number\s*:\s+${SERIAL}\s*$$
  ^Switch\s+\d+ -> Detail

EOF
